{"id":"59372eb943ddfc66","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-rice.md","title":"Rice定理","display":"thm-rice — Rice定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-rice","aliases":["43-thm-rice"],"display":"thm-rice — Rice定理","depends_on":["[[43-df-index-set]]","[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-thm-smn]]","[[43-thm-halting]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"Theorem 5.2.3, print p.11 / PDF p.31","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-rice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-rice</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-rice — Rice定理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"30257659a1c56ffc\" href=\"?note=30257659a1c56ffc\" title=\"43-df-index-set\">43-df-index-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8d72cd0153942f61\" href=\"?note=8d72cd0153942f61\" title=\"43-thm-smn\">43-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ac91e97f1abbec1a\" href=\"?note=ac91e97f1abbec1a\" title=\"43-thm-halting\">43-thm-halting</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 5.2.3, print p.11 / PDF p.31"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(I\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>为程序外延编号集。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IndexSet}\">\\(\\operatorname{IndexSet}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Computable}\">\\(\\operatorname{Computable}\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"30257659a1c56ffc\" href=\"?note=30257659a1c56ffc\" title=\"43-df-index-set\">43-df-index-set</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_I\">\\(\\chi_I\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 的特征函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IndexSet}(I)\\Rightarrow(\\operatorname{Computable}(\\chi_I)\\leftrightarrow(I=\\varnothing\\lor I=\\mathbb N)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IndexSet}(I)\\Rightarrow(\\operatorname{Computable}(\\chi_I)\\leftrightarrow(I=\\varnothing\\lor I=\\mathbb N)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>固定空部分函数与语义不同的一个程序，通过s-m-n按对角停机结果选择其行为，把停机问题归约到I或其补。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 5.2.3, print p.11 / PDF p.31。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-index-set","status":"resolved","id":"30257659a1c56ffc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-index-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8d72cd0153942f61","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-halting","status":"resolved","id":"ac91e97f1abbec1a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-halting]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-index-set","status":"resolved","id":"30257659a1c56ffc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{IndexSet}$、$\\operatorname{Computable}$ 分别采用 [[43-df-index-set]]、[[43-df-computable]]；$\\chi_I$ 为 $I$ 的特征函数。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{IndexSet}$、$\\operatorname{Computable}$ 分别采用 [[43-df-index-set]]、[[43-df-computable]]；$\\chi_I$ 为 $I$ 的特征函数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"I\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IndexSet}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Computable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_I","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IndexSet}(I)\\Rightarrow(\\operatorname{Computable}(\\chi_I)\\leftrightarrow(I=\\varnothing\\lor I=\\mathbb N)).","display":true}],"bytes":1093,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-73","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-rice]] — Rice定理"}],"outgoing":["30257659a1c56ffc","f357216a7edb035a","8d72cd0153942f61","ac91e97f1abbec1a"]}